    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Khorne Daemonkin",
    "summary": "Whenever one of your BLOOD LEGIONS or WORLD EATERS units wipes out an enemy unit, roll a D6: a 3 or more earns you 1 BTP (Blood Tithe point). As each Command phase starts, yours or your opponent's, you may pay BTP to switch on one of the abilities below; it stays active until the battle ends.\n• Enraged Abjuration [2BTP]: **[Feel No Pain 5+](vsdata:core-ability/feel-no-pain)** against mortal wounds and Psychic Attacks for every BLOOD LEGIONS or WORLD EATERS model in your army.\n• Daemonic Rage [3BTP]: your BLOOD LEGIONS units' melee weapons gain **[[LANCE]](vsdata:weapon-ability/lance)**.\n• Boon of Blood [4BTP]: your BLOOD LEGIONS units get an invulnerable save of 4+.\n• Might of Khorne [5BTP]: your BLOOD LEGIONS units are granted Blessings of Khorne.",
